{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj45REF2gEcX1XA8W5tn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, worn keyhole set in old oak.*\n\n*A cold draft breathes through me from the other side.*\n\n*I am waiting.*\n\n*I have always been waiting.*\n\n*Insert the key and I will tell you what I guard. But choose carefully — I accept only the one that was made for me, and there have been so many pretenders.*\n\n*Their scratches line my tumbler walls like tallies on a prison stone.*\n\n🔒"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":108,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}